    "title": "Who from Hamilton County area's former high school athletes will participate in games on Saturday, Dec. 20?",
    "text": "These former Hamilton County high school stars set for games on Saturday, Dec. 20.\nBrett Wright Trevecca Nazarene Trojans Forward Sophomore 6′7″ Silverdale Baptist Academy Hometown: Chattanooga Next Game: vs. West Florida Argonauts, Saturday, Dec. 20, 4 p.m.\nBrycen Sanders Ole Miss Rebels Sophomore 6′6″ 310 Baylor School Hometown: Chattanooga Next Game: vs. Tulane Green Wave, Saturday, Dec. 20, 2:30 p.m.\nCamden Andrews Flagler Saints Guard Junior 6′1″ 175 Hamilton Heights Christian Academy Hometown: Memphis Next Game: vs. Fort Lauderdale Eagles, Saturday, Dec. 20, 2 p.m.\nJohn Pecarich Bemidji State Beavers Guard Junior 6′3″ 185 Brainerd High School Hometown: Baxter Next Game: vs. Minot State Beavers, Saturday, Dec. 20, 1:30 p.m.\nLucas Brown Jr. Valdosta State Blazers Guard Senior 6′2″ 190 Red Bank High School Hometown: Chattanooga Next Game: vs. Lee Flames, Saturday, Dec. 20, 4 p.m.\nMarcus Tankersley Chicago State Cougars Guard Senior 6′5″ 195 Hamilton Heights Christian Academy Hometown: Chattanooga Next Game: vs. Indiana Hoosiers, Saturday, Dec. 20, 1 p.m.\nShekai Mills-Knight Ole Miss Rebels Freshman 6′2″ 225 Baylor School Next Game: vs. Tulane Green Wave, Saturday, Dec. 20, 2:30 p.m.\nTim Vaughn Lee Flames Forward Senior 6′5″ 210 Notre Dame High School Hometown: Chattanooga Next Game: vs. Valdosta State Blazers, Saturday, Dec. 20, 4 p.m.",
